    <div class="email-max-width margin-auto" id="EmailWrapper"><div class="background-neutral-2 padding-l" id="Email"><div class="background-neutral-0 padding-l border-radius-medium" id="Content"><div class="margin-bottom-base margin-top-base" style="&&v3_Style&&">&&#KigsrG178ik6_1JzWhROg4w_&&&&/KigsrG178ik6_1JzWhROg4w_&&&&^KigsrG178ik6_1JzWhROg4w_&&&&#KNSPtgPkSo029sfMA4Uj8XQ_&&<span class="flag-isdev text-align-center">DEV</span>&&/KNSPtgPkSo029sfMA4Uj8XQ_&&&&^KNSPtgPkSo029sfMA4Uj8XQ_&&&&#Kx7czcqwN_UWU_vDEBxegow_&&<span class="flag-isqa text-align-center">QA</span>&&/Kx7czcqwN_UWU_vDEBxegow_&&&&^Kx7czcqwN_UWU_vDEBxegow_&&&&/Kx7czcqwN_UWU_vDEBxegow_&&&&/KNSPtgPkSo029sfMA4Uj8XQ_&&&&/KigsrG178ik6_1JzWhROg4w_&&</div><div class="email-logo text-align-left" id="Logo"><img alt="Company Logo" src="&&KJGQAZPwDMEqUI_utmsJRQw_HREF&&"/><span class="ThemeGrid_MarginGutter">&&K2NfGF4bjSE_pqKKggeCDIA_Value&&</span></div><div class="margin-bottom-base heading5" id="Title" style="&&v8_Style&&">&&#KZwT_Kx_JDkG7VCebjMj0zQ_&&&&KtwuS8rwn5ku94g82ofIRmg_Value&&&&/KZwT_Kx_JDkG7VCebjMj0zQ_&&&&^KZwT_Kx_JDkG7VCebjMj0zQ_&&Hola!&&/KZwT_Kx_JDkG7VCebjMj0zQ_&&</div><div class="margin-bottom-m" id="Message">Est&#225;s recibiendo este correo electr&#243;nico porque los siguientes folios le han sido reasignados:</div><div class="margin-bottom-m">&&KPzl2mNUlc0qjtJTcb2I_Cg_Value&&</div><div class="margin-bottom-m" id="Message2">A continuaci&#243;n encontrar&#225;s la justificaci&#243;n correspondiente a esta reasignaci&#243;n. Si necesitas m&#225;s informaci&#243;n o aclaraciones adicionales, por favor comun&#237;cate con nosotros a trav&#233;s de los canales habituales.</div><div class="margin-bottom-m"><div class="heading2 margin-bottom-s"><span style="&&v13_Style&&">&&K7EXDu4QzE0GSC0yG47rQuA_Value&&</span></div></div><div class="margin-bottom-s">&&KicPc6E3RGUKLrFZlz3TnZQ_Value&&<a enabled="true" href="&&KDsVd4FeQc0qUpGwDgH9ngw_HREF&&">Portal Conecta Proveedores</a></div><div>Gracias,<br><span style="&&v19_Style&&">&&KLkmCETBUcUGp2_3BLWhx9g_Value&&</span></div><div class="email-separator"></div><div class="font-size-xs text-neutral-7" id="Copyright">&#169; <span style="&&v22_Style&&">&&K6vfNsjnpikugssV1zFrv2Q_Value&&</span>&#160;&&KmIJDVI7ezEaTTm3uZ3Amuw_Value&&. Todos los derechos reservados.</div>&&#KqE8Q8jTHhE2fMRyHXE5_yg_&&&&/KqE8Q8jTHhE2fMRyHXE5_yg_&&&&^KqE8Q8jTHhE2fMRyHXE5_yg_&&<div class="margin-top-base"><span class="font-size-xs OSFillParent">&&K_tMgMZ23SUqVf0JMvXtjRw_Value&&</span></div>&&/KqE8Q8jTHhE2fMRyHXE5_yg_&&</div><div class="margin-top-m" id="Footer"></div></div></div>
